WEBVTT

00:43.835 --> 00:45.420
I'm sure it's obvious.

00:46.004 --> 00:47.589
He liked me first.

00:50.258 --> 00:51.384
Is that what she said?

00:52.510 --> 00:53.636
Is she ill or something?

00:53.720 --> 00:58.057
He followed me around
even after the documentary had ended.

00:58.141 --> 01:00.852
I believe he asked me out first.

01:02.854 --> 01:05.190
Gosh, I should've snapped out of it
and run away

01:05.273 --> 01:06.941
when she threw herself at me.

01:09.360 --> 01:12.781
Well, I don't remember.

01:12.864 --> 01:15.950
It's not anything
worth remembering after all.

01:16.785 --> 01:19.829
She doesn't remember? My gosh.

01:20.455 --> 01:22.415
I remember clearly.

01:22.499 --> 01:25.835
It was that day
when everything started going haywire.

01:28.254 --> 01:29.923
Gosh.

01:30.006 --> 01:33.301
It was the final day of the shoot.

01:33.968 --> 01:35.220
It's raining cats and dogs.

01:35.804 --> 01:37.806
This wasn't in the forecast.

01:37.889 --> 01:39.098
How's your camera?

01:39.182 --> 01:40.475
It's fine.

01:41.059 --> 01:43.561
But we do have a problem.
It has run out of battery.

01:44.229 --> 01:45.188
What?

01:45.271 --> 01:48.525
This is the perfect place
to end our shoot.

01:49.692 --> 01:52.445
I'm sure this is just a sudden shower.

01:52.987 --> 01:55.573
Let me go get more batteries
and some umbrellas.

01:55.657 --> 01:58.701
Wait here.
We have to have our final interview.

01:58.785 --> 02:00.328
Just the two of us?

02:00.411 --> 02:01.955
It won't take long.

02:02.038 --> 02:03.498
Let me go with…

02:17.303 --> 02:18.638
How should I put it?

02:19.639 --> 02:23.268
Everything felt awkward that day.

02:25.854 --> 02:27.730
It was just very awkward.

02:27.814 --> 02:30.567
It was sunny until just a while ago.

02:31.317 --> 02:32.360
I know.

02:42.412 --> 02:45.373
I started worrying about her
all of a sudden.

03:04.434 --> 03:05.560
What's this for?

03:12.191 --> 03:13.318
Thanks.

03:17.488 --> 03:20.074
Everything felt a bit different.

03:20.158 --> 03:21.492
Aren't you cold?

03:22.452 --> 03:23.912
No. Not at all.

03:29.834 --> 03:32.295
Maybe it was
because it was our last shoot.

03:49.771 --> 03:50.980
And…

03:51.898 --> 03:54.234
I wasn't the only one who felt that way.

03:56.319 --> 03:57.820
She also…

04:01.199 --> 04:02.992
Don't make me laugh.

04:04.452 --> 04:05.828
Is that what he said?

04:07.455 --> 04:09.540
He's fabricated his memory again.

04:13.503 --> 04:16.089
It wasn't like that at all.

04:16.172 --> 04:17.298
What are you looking at?

04:22.387 --> 04:24.931
It was like every other day.

04:26.307 --> 04:28.935
Stop distracting me and sit down.

04:34.816 --> 04:38.903
It was sunny until just a while ago.

04:38.987 --> 04:40.363
Atmospheric instability.

04:40.989 --> 04:43.574
The upper layers of the atmosphere
contain cool air.

04:43.658 --> 04:46.995
The sharp increase in temperature
has made the atmosphere unstable.

04:47.078 --> 04:49.038
The strong updraft creates rain clouds--

04:49.122 --> 04:52.667
Do you have to do this now?
You're tiring me out.

04:53.251 --> 04:56.337
I'm only telling you since you probably
didn't pay attention in class.

04:57.630 --> 04:59.632
Choi Ung was still dumb as usual.

05:11.102 --> 05:12.603
And he was still an idiot.

05:12.687 --> 05:13.563
What are you doing?

05:15.648 --> 05:17.525
Oh, did you notice?

05:22.113 --> 05:24.240
- Just keep it on.
- It's okay.

05:24.324 --> 05:26.242
No, don't force yourself. Just wear it.

05:26.326 --> 05:28.077
No, I'm fine.

05:28.161 --> 05:29.120
Gosh.

05:29.203 --> 05:30.872
Take it. Here.

05:40.673 --> 05:43.843
The minor details may be different but…

05:45.178 --> 05:48.931
He must remember himself
as some really amazing guy.

05:49.015 --> 05:51.893
She must remember herself
as being all nonchalant,

05:51.976 --> 05:54.187
but she was the one who was odd that day.

05:54.270 --> 05:57.190
I was just being my usual self that day.

05:57.273 --> 05:59.275
It was unlike her to do that.

05:59.358 --> 06:00.651
He was the one who--

06:00.735 --> 06:02.862
She was setting the mood.

06:11.079 --> 06:12.497
I need to move the cabbage.

06:13.539 --> 06:16.918
You're not going to mention
how she and I dated, are you?

06:17.001 --> 06:18.461
I'm not sure. That's up to me.

06:18.544 --> 06:20.296
Are you insane? You can't.

06:21.297 --> 06:23.424
As the producer, I have the right.

06:24.509 --> 06:26.636
Ni*e, C*ca *ola, M****ald's.

06:26.719 --> 06:28.638
S**s***, V*lv*, Lo*** Vui****on, Cha*el.

06:28.721 --> 06:31.349
****ole, ****ard, **it.

06:31.432 --> 06:33.601
**tch, *****ss, ****er,

06:34.185 --> 06:36.312
***** you, **** you, **** off.

06:37.730 --> 06:39.482
Air it if you want,

06:39.565 --> 06:41.484
but you'll have to censor
everything I say.

06:42.068 --> 06:43.486
You guys are like twins.

06:43.569 --> 06:47.365
Don't you dare mention
anything about us dating.

06:47.865 --> 06:49.367
Are we done?

06:50.451 --> 06:53.663
THE BOY, OR THE GIRL, WE LIKED THEN

06:53.746 --> 06:57.708
EPISODE 4

06:59.168 --> 07:03.005
So these are your terms?

07:03.089 --> 07:05.842
I'll be straightforward
since you know everything.

07:05.925 --> 07:07.969
We're not doing this because we want to.

07:08.052 --> 07:10.346
In fact, it'll be extremely uncomfortable.

07:11.472 --> 07:13.516
Is it uncomfortable for you? Not me.

07:13.599 --> 07:15.601
Gosh. I wonder why.

07:15.685 --> 07:17.019
Really? Are you?

07:17.603 --> 07:19.313
I'm relieved.

07:19.397 --> 07:23.025
Since you're quite childish and pathetic,

07:23.109 --> 07:24.360
I was worried about you.

07:25.027 --> 07:26.571
Pathetic?

07:27.238 --> 07:30.158
I beg to differ. A lot of time has passed.

07:30.241 --> 07:32.827
And as you can see,
I've changed quite a bit. Well…

07:33.661 --> 07:37.248
I'm successful enough for someone
to visit and beg to work with me.

07:37.331 --> 07:40.251
Hey. I never begged.

07:40.835 --> 07:43.546
You're the one
who picked a fight by calling me pathetic.

07:43.629 --> 07:44.797
I'm sorry,

07:45.465 --> 07:47.467
but can I read this in peace?

07:54.307 --> 07:55.808
DO NOT FILM MY PRIVATE LIFE
WITHOUT CONSENT

07:55.892 --> 07:57.977
VIOLATION OF THE ABOVE TERMS
WILL LEAD TO TERMINATION OF THE SHOOT

08:00.480 --> 08:01.772
TERMS AND CONDITIONS

08:01.856 --> 08:03.941
DO NOT ANNOY ME
DO NOT BOTHER ME

08:06.027 --> 08:09.572
All right. I'll do my best
to respect your wishes.

08:10.948 --> 08:14.160
First of all, you need to get used
to having cameras around you.

08:14.243 --> 08:17.830
We won't do anything special.
You can go on with your daily lives.

08:17.914 --> 08:20.625
We'll also film you two
spending time together.

08:21.292 --> 08:25.254
All I do is go to work then go home.
Would that be okay?

08:25.838 --> 08:28.049
And I doubt my boss will let you film me.

08:28.132 --> 08:30.468
He's already said yes, so we'll be there.

08:30.551 --> 08:32.803
He was happy
his project would gain attention.

08:33.429 --> 08:35.598
I can't work
if there are others around me.

08:35.681 --> 08:37.517
Then we'll just set up the camera.

08:37.600 --> 08:40.895
Do you honestly think
this will be entertaining?

08:40.978 --> 08:43.189
I can already see that it'll be boring.

08:43.272 --> 08:46.234
That's up to me to decide,
so don't you worry.

08:46.317 --> 08:47.944
Any other questions?

08:48.027 --> 08:51.531
The both of you seem to be
okay with the shoot.

08:51.614 --> 08:52.698
Everything's fine, right?

08:54.075 --> 08:55.201
Let's give it a shot.

09:02.500 --> 09:05.086
Ji-ung. I'm afraid this will be a flop.

09:20.059 --> 09:21.894
Hey, I'm here!

09:25.189 --> 09:26.190
What's this?

09:28.568 --> 09:29.819
Are you filming again?

09:31.821 --> 09:33.489
Are you filming him too?

09:34.490 --> 09:36.200
- Hello.
- Hey.

09:36.284 --> 09:40.162
By the way… Hey.
What's the concept for today?

09:40.246 --> 09:43.165
Don't worry about that.
You can just go ahead and eat.

09:43.249 --> 09:45.835
- How could I not worry about that?
- Goodness.

09:45.918 --> 09:48.713
Chang-sik, you're here. Over here.

09:48.796 --> 09:51.507
By the way, Ji-ung,
are you not filming my hardware store?

09:51.591 --> 09:52.425
Gosh.

09:56.679 --> 09:58.556
You're doing this again with Ung?

09:58.639 --> 09:59.890
Have you gone insane?

10:00.850 --> 10:02.935
Do you think I wanted to do this?

10:03.019 --> 10:05.438
This is just one of those things
I can't help but do

10:05.521 --> 10:07.356
just to make ends meet.

10:07.440 --> 10:09.525
Are you okay seeing him again?

10:09.609 --> 10:12.361
- Are you guys--
- Enough with your nonsense.

10:14.947 --> 10:16.824
What's over is over.

10:16.907 --> 10:19.535
- Get a grip, okay?
- It's not like that.

10:21.329 --> 10:22.955
When did you get here?

10:23.039 --> 10:25.541
Don't worry about us and talk freely.

10:25.625 --> 10:28.628
You won't be able
to air this if we talk freely.

10:28.711 --> 10:32.632
Most office workers
rest or sleep on the weekends,

10:32.715 --> 10:33.883
but not me.

10:34.467 --> 10:37.303
I hate wasting time.

10:37.386 --> 10:40.264
That's why spend my weekends productively.

10:40.348 --> 10:43.768
Usually, I jog in the morning.

10:45.227 --> 10:47.188
- I don't like naps.
- She's enjoying this.

10:47.271 --> 10:48.814
You should only sleep at night.

10:49.315 --> 10:52.735
I hate being lazy in the day
and taking naps like someone does.

10:52.818 --> 10:55.196
Anyway, I'll take it slow today.

10:55.279 --> 10:56.489
Follow me.

10:59.283 --> 11:01.827
It's so obvious
she was looking forward to this.

11:03.204 --> 11:05.122
What is she trying to do?

11:31.399 --> 11:32.775
STAR START-UP COMPANY

12:03.597 --> 12:05.141
It's our new menu. Try it.

12:13.315 --> 12:14.775
How is it? Good, right?

12:14.859 --> 12:17.945
- Not really.
- Go home. Why are you here?

12:18.028 --> 12:19.155
Get lost.

12:22.741 --> 12:26.662
Hey, stop filming and
come help me peel these onions.

12:26.745 --> 12:28.330
Consider me invisible.

12:29.165 --> 12:31.250
Poor Mr. Kim.

12:31.333 --> 12:34.420
You need to make this entertaining,
yet here I am, peeling onions.

12:36.130 --> 12:38.382
Should I peel them
in an entertaining manner?

12:40.968 --> 12:42.178
He must be insane.

12:46.932 --> 12:49.185
Hi, guys.

12:49.268 --> 12:50.311
Why the long faces?

12:52.813 --> 12:54.815
Where are the new staff members?

12:55.524 --> 12:56.525
Right.

12:57.985 --> 12:59.069
- Bye.
- Dong-il.

13:00.154 --> 13:01.780
I'm doing my best,

13:01.864 --> 13:03.115
but they're already busy.

13:03.199 --> 13:06.035
The ones who are available
don't want to work with you.

13:06.118 --> 13:07.536
That's not my fault.

13:07.620 --> 13:11.540
How could you not help us
after forcing me to do this?

13:11.624 --> 13:12.958
All right.

13:13.042 --> 13:16.420
I promise to send you some reliable staff,

13:17.963 --> 13:19.423
so hang in there.

13:20.174 --> 13:22.384
Chae-ran, I'm sorry
you have to go through this.

13:28.140 --> 13:30.518
- Any salvageable footage?
- No, not at all.

13:34.522 --> 13:35.898
Call them over right now.

13:38.817 --> 13:39.902
What?

13:41.028 --> 13:42.112
Ji-ung.

13:44.448 --> 13:45.491
Are you not here?

13:48.661 --> 13:49.537
Did he leave?

14:01.757 --> 14:06.178
This filming could come to an end
more quickly than I expected.

14:12.017 --> 14:13.352
Finally, some peace.

14:42.172 --> 14:45.092
I can't sleep deeply.

14:49.763 --> 14:52.266
I'm always half-awake.

14:59.982 --> 15:03.986
I probably have 500 dreams at a time.

15:16.457 --> 15:19.001
That's why I often can't differentiate

15:19.585 --> 15:21.712
a dream from reality.

15:31.680 --> 15:34.224
- Hey.
- This is probably a dream.

15:34.308 --> 15:35.559
Are you all right?

16:15.683 --> 16:17.434
- What was that?
- What?

16:18.018 --> 16:20.104
What? What are you doing here?

16:20.729 --> 16:22.147
What was that?

16:22.815 --> 16:24.358
You're real.

16:24.441 --> 16:26.902
What are you talking about?
Were you dreaming?

16:26.986 --> 16:29.405
When did you come here?

16:29.488 --> 16:31.949
You came over unannounced. I was startled.

16:32.032 --> 16:33.367
I just arrived.

16:33.951 --> 16:35.202
Ji-ung wanted to talk.

16:36.829 --> 16:38.706
Why are you sleeping during the day?

16:39.498 --> 16:40.708
I can't sleep well.

16:41.458 --> 16:42.418
Why not?

16:50.592 --> 16:51.844
Where's Ji-ung?

16:53.429 --> 16:54.930
He went out for a minute.

16:55.514 --> 16:56.390
I see.

17:00.477 --> 17:01.562
Gosh.

17:18.912 --> 17:23.167
I'm going to head down to my studio.

17:23.959 --> 17:24.835
What?

17:26.253 --> 17:29.757
If you have nothing to do,
check out my drawings.

17:32.885 --> 17:35.262
They're downstairs.

17:59.203 --> 18:00.871
I love that one.

18:02.331 --> 18:03.957
Don't study them too closely.

18:04.541 --> 18:06.502
Where's that building?

18:07.628 --> 18:09.755
Oh, this one?

18:10.297 --> 18:12.674
It's in Paris.

18:12.758 --> 18:16.845
He designed Soen Shop.
He's my favorite architect.

18:17.387 --> 18:19.848
I see. So that's why
you took up on the offer.

18:20.432 --> 18:21.350
Yes.

18:28.315 --> 18:29.942
This is really unexpected.

18:30.943 --> 18:32.194
What do you mean?

18:32.277 --> 18:36.073
Back then, when you were always drawing,

18:36.156 --> 18:38.492
I thought you just didn't want to study.

18:38.575 --> 18:41.286
Hey, everyone has their own forte.

18:41.370 --> 18:44.331
Yet you nagged me
to study day in, day out.

18:44.998 --> 18:46.959
Do you finally realize
how sadistic you are?

18:47.042 --> 18:49.586
Thanks to my nagging,
you attended university.

18:57.678 --> 18:58.762
What?

19:02.057 --> 19:03.142
Isn't this…

19:19.825 --> 19:22.286
Oh, no. My bad.

19:24.580 --> 19:26.790
Hey, this is nothing serious.

19:26.874 --> 19:28.834
- You can just erase it.
- No…

19:36.425 --> 19:38.427
- Please turn off the camera.
- Please don't.

19:39.136 --> 19:41.805
- Please do.
- No, please don't turn it off.

19:45.392 --> 19:47.060
Hey, Kook Yeon-su!

19:47.144 --> 19:49.021
Come with me. Damn it.

21:21.697 --> 21:23.031
You said you threw it away.

21:23.824 --> 21:26.451
I thought I did. Why was this in there?

21:27.119 --> 21:29.579
You caused a scene
and blamed me for ruining it.

21:29.663 --> 21:32.416
See? If you just glance at it,
you can't even tell.

21:32.499 --> 21:35.627
It's true that you ruined it.
And it does show if you look closely.

21:35.711 --> 21:37.546
Come on. That's not too bad.

21:37.629 --> 21:40.799
Yet you were so petty and sulked for days.

21:41.591 --> 21:43.468
This isn't the only thing you ruined.

21:44.386 --> 21:47.597
Hey, I only messed up your drawings once…

21:48.765 --> 21:50.892
No, twice. That's all.

21:51.727 --> 21:53.562
You also ruined my life.

21:54.479 --> 21:55.480
You caused havoc.

21:56.898 --> 21:58.150
I shouldn't have said that.

21:58.233 --> 21:59.067
Hey.

22:01.570 --> 22:03.071
That was a bit harsh.

22:07.200 --> 22:08.744
What did I ruin?

22:10.329 --> 22:12.205
Why did I say that?

22:12.289 --> 22:15.834
What is this?
Are you not going to explain yourself?

22:16.752 --> 22:17.627
It's true, though.

22:20.297 --> 22:22.966
Why do I get so upset like this at times?

22:24.009 --> 22:26.053
How long will you keep this up?

22:26.136 --> 22:29.264
How badly did I ruin your life?

22:29.348 --> 22:32.392
Look at this.
You're doing very well. Where's the havoc?

22:32.476 --> 22:35.103
Maybe it's hard to tell at a glance
just like this drawing.

22:40.192 --> 22:42.444
How long are you going to keep
guilt-tripping me?

22:43.820 --> 22:47.866
We've agreed to do this documentary,
so can't we please just get along?

22:48.784 --> 22:50.202
That was my intention too.

22:51.036 --> 22:53.955
I'm sorry I can't be as nonchalant as you.

22:55.040 --> 22:57.876
So why am I being so pathetic?

23:07.302 --> 23:10.430
You think you're the only victim here
since I'm not saying anything.

23:10.514 --> 23:11.681
You're ridiculous.

23:11.765 --> 23:13.600
Then speak your mind.

23:15.060 --> 23:17.354
Do you think
I'm solely to blame for our breakup?

23:36.623 --> 23:38.041
Stop filming, Ji-ung.

23:38.917 --> 23:40.794
Gosh. How did you know?

23:40.877 --> 23:43.088
Are you just going to film everything?

23:44.131 --> 23:46.716
Well, that is my job.

23:46.800 --> 23:49.302
What took you so long?
Let's go up and talk.

23:52.264 --> 23:53.431
Let's go.

24:05.026 --> 24:07.028
The atmosphere feels tense.

24:10.240 --> 24:11.449
Or is it just me?

24:16.788 --> 24:20.959
I'm sorry, but I have other plans today.
I should go. Give me a call later.

24:29.301 --> 24:30.635
Then how about you…

24:31.636 --> 24:33.972
I'm having second thoughts
about this documentary.

24:40.937 --> 24:42.230
It's a total mess.

24:42.314 --> 24:43.648
We couldn't even talk about the concept.

24:43.732 --> 24:45.692
We did see this coming, though.

24:47.319 --> 24:50.447
Should we just continue
following them around?

24:52.157 --> 24:53.200
Let's call it a day.

24:53.283 --> 24:55.619
Are you going home? I'll drop you off.

25:01.458 --> 25:03.460
We should start with their reviews.

25:03.543 --> 25:04.377
What?

25:04.461 --> 25:06.671
On how they felt when they first met,

25:06.755 --> 25:09.341
why they had agreed
to film the documentary ten years ago,

25:10.217 --> 25:12.344
and how they feel after being reunited.

25:12.928 --> 25:15.263
Let's make them reminisce
the good memories.

25:15.347 --> 25:16.431
Right.

25:17.349 --> 25:19.184
They dated each other, didn't they?

25:19.976 --> 25:20.810
Can you tell?

25:20.894 --> 25:23.772
After watching the documentary
and seeing them in person,

25:23.855 --> 25:25.106
it was too obvious.

25:25.982 --> 25:28.401
You're very quick.
No wonder you're our star employee.

25:30.278 --> 25:32.364
When did you first meet Mr. Choi?

25:32.447 --> 25:34.157
At the elementary entrance ceremony.

25:34.741 --> 25:36.284
He was standing behind me.

25:36.368 --> 25:37.911
He shouldn't have been there.

25:38.495 --> 25:40.288
He seemed quite charming.

25:40.372 --> 25:42.540
He must have been popular in high school.

25:42.624 --> 25:44.251
I'll take back that compliment.

25:44.334 --> 25:45.794
You're a terrible judge of character.

25:49.297 --> 25:50.632
Yeon-su was the popular one.

25:50.715 --> 25:51.883
Ms. Kook?

25:52.801 --> 25:56.263
I could tell, although she looked cold
in the documentary.

25:56.346 --> 25:58.848
That's why the boys
found her unapproachable.

25:59.808 --> 26:03.436
She probably doesn't know this,
but many guys had a crush on her.

26:06.439 --> 26:08.316
Were you friends with Ms. Kook too?

26:09.567 --> 26:10.652
I'm not sure.

26:11.319 --> 26:13.822
I think I've always been just an observer.

26:15.907 --> 26:17.701
I think we're almost there.

26:18.201 --> 26:19.744
You can pull up over there.

26:22.330 --> 26:25.083
Don't come in early tomorrow.
There's not much to do.

26:25.166 --> 26:26.543
Did you know?

26:26.626 --> 26:29.587
Our colleagues think
you're very cold and unfriendly.

26:29.671 --> 26:31.798
I know I'm not popular.

26:31.881 --> 26:34.301
That's why no one wants to work with me.

26:34.884 --> 26:35.969
You are popular.

26:36.052 --> 26:38.096
It's just that you seem unapproachable.

26:38.680 --> 26:42.434
You probably don't know this,
but I bet many women have a crush on you.

26:44.269 --> 26:45.520
What was that?

26:46.104 --> 26:47.856
Thanks. It's comforting.

26:48.523 --> 26:51.151
I wish more people knew this side of you.

26:51.735 --> 26:53.361
Thank you for dropping me off.

26:53.445 --> 26:54.738
Sure. Take care.

26:57.824 --> 27:00.160
What is this? Who is he?

27:00.243 --> 27:03.621
Didn't you see him?
He was in the car all along.

27:04.289 --> 27:07.042
- Who is he?
- He's our reliable help sent by Mr. Park.

27:07.625 --> 27:08.501
He's an intern.

27:09.127 --> 27:11.338
Hello, sir. My name is Im Tae-hun.

27:11.921 --> 27:12.797
An intern?

27:12.881 --> 27:16.468
He started yesterday
and hasn't gone home since.

27:16.551 --> 27:17.635
I'm fine.

27:17.719 --> 27:19.220
Why would he send him to us?

27:19.721 --> 27:21.431
This isn't a daycare.

27:21.514 --> 27:24.017
This isn't the first time
he's done something like this.

27:24.100 --> 27:25.477
Damn it.

27:26.144 --> 27:28.355
Everything about this documentary
is going awry.

27:28.438 --> 27:29.689
Send him back.

27:30.273 --> 27:31.316
I'd rather work alone.

27:34.736 --> 27:35.570
- Get out.
- Sorry?

27:35.653 --> 27:36.571
- Okay.
- Okay.

27:51.628 --> 27:54.214
You also ruined my life. You caused havoc.

27:54.798 --> 27:57.550
Why did I have to say that
and sound pathetic?

27:59.302 --> 28:00.261
Damn it.

28:10.814 --> 28:12.482
I guess I won't be sleeping tonight.

28:18.780 --> 28:21.449
Do you think
I'm only to blame for our breakup?

28:22.492 --> 28:25.870
Gosh, I shouldn't have said that.

28:26.913 --> 28:30.750
Yeon-su, are you insane?
You should have kept your cool.

28:55.608 --> 28:58.319
I have to do this for an entire month?

29:11.833 --> 29:13.918
HE'S LYING DOWN, HE'S SLEEPING

29:17.714 --> 29:19.424
What should I do with them?

29:24.971 --> 29:28.767
In any case,
I'm glad that we could do this together.

29:28.850 --> 29:32.479
It's our pleasure.
We're truly honored to work with you.

29:32.562 --> 29:34.272
It wasn't easy,

29:34.355 --> 29:37.025
but Ms. Kook truly put her heart into it.

29:37.609 --> 29:39.194
Oh, I'm flattered.

29:40.820 --> 29:45.116
I hope this documentary
can also be used to promote our project.

29:45.200 --> 29:49.788
And I'd like to meet
with the artist in person.

29:49.871 --> 29:51.998
Then we can all meet here--

29:52.081 --> 29:53.666
No, I'll go to you.

29:53.750 --> 29:57.086
It must be a hassle for you
to come all the way here.

29:57.170 --> 29:59.631
It'll be better
since I'm the only one going there.

29:59.714 --> 30:02.550
We'd be very grateful
if you could do that.

30:02.634 --> 30:03.927
Shall we end the meeting?

30:04.010 --> 30:06.179
Right. Go first without me.

30:06.846 --> 30:10.475
We'll be holding
a small opening party this Friday.

30:10.558 --> 30:13.186
- If you're free--
- A party? That'd be great.

30:18.149 --> 30:20.777
Will you be able to attend as well?

30:20.860 --> 30:22.737
- I--
- You should come too.

30:23.696 --> 30:27.575
Sure. I'll go if I'm not busy.

30:27.659 --> 30:30.578
I'd like to speak
with Ms. Kook in private.

30:30.662 --> 30:32.038
Okay.

30:35.792 --> 30:38.711
- What do you think?
- Looking at them again, it's convincing.

30:38.795 --> 30:41.381
- What's this about?
- I'm 900-percent certain.

30:41.464 --> 30:42.632
Come here.

30:42.715 --> 30:44.425
- Hurry up.
- What about Ms. Kook?

30:45.009 --> 30:46.135
I have no idea.

30:47.220 --> 30:48.388
Your work is loved

30:48.471 --> 30:51.724
- by many people these days.
- What? He even makes TV appearances?

30:51.808 --> 30:54.561
What do you think won their hearts?

30:54.644 --> 30:57.188
- I'm not sure.
- Did you pull an all-nighter?

30:57.272 --> 30:58.982
You were still filming.

30:59.065 --> 31:00.358
Hello.

31:00.441 --> 31:02.569
You've ruined my morning
with that mug of his.

31:03.111 --> 31:05.864
Nu-a is even making
TV appearances these days.

31:07.073 --> 31:08.408
I don't care.

31:09.075 --> 31:11.578
It's about time you revealed yourself

31:11.661 --> 31:14.205
and got rid of all the copycats.

31:14.289 --> 31:15.832
Should I schedule an interview?

31:15.915 --> 31:18.877
No, thanks.
What's my schedule for the week?

31:18.960 --> 31:22.380
- You have a meeting for that live how.
- People are saying that your drawings

31:22.463 --> 31:24.424
- are quite similar to Go-oh's.
- What?

31:24.507 --> 31:25.592
- Really?
- And then?

31:25.675 --> 31:28.344
- What is that bastard saying?
- People are even saying

31:28.428 --> 31:29.804
that this is plagiarism.

31:29.888 --> 31:31.472
What's your take on this?

31:31.556 --> 31:33.516
Ung. Come here right now.

31:33.600 --> 31:35.476
This is serious. Hurry up.

31:35.560 --> 31:37.770
- What is it this time?
- I'm not sure.

31:37.854 --> 31:41.983
- Plagiarism? I don't know about that.
- That bastard is ridiculing you right now.

31:42.066 --> 31:45.486
Plagiarism isn't always black and white.

31:45.570 --> 31:46.821
- Right.
- Right.

31:46.905 --> 31:49.741
I'm sure that Go-oh knows best
whether they plagiarized me or not.

31:49.824 --> 31:53.578
Or maybe I just inspired them.

31:54.245 --> 31:56.080
- I don't mind at all.
- I see.

31:57.624 --> 32:00.543
Has he gone insane?
He's accusing you of plagiarism.

32:00.627 --> 32:03.880
This won't do. Ung, don't worry.
I'll contact all the reporters I know.

32:03.963 --> 32:05.548
Forget it. Ignore him.

32:05.632 --> 32:08.509
How can I ignore him
after what he just said?

32:08.593 --> 32:10.803
Don't bother responding. It's tiring.

32:10.887 --> 32:13.765
You don't have to do anything.
I'll take care of it. I'll call--

32:15.099 --> 32:17.602
Don't do anything
if you want to keep your job.

32:30.281 --> 32:32.825
Ms. Kook, you should see this.

32:40.083 --> 32:41.501
IS KO-O GUILTY OF PLAGIARISM?

32:41.584 --> 32:45.129
What should we do?
Should we report this to Soen?

32:47.674 --> 32:50.176
I'll talk to Soen about this.

32:50.259 --> 32:52.845
And don't contact the artist. Just wait.

32:52.929 --> 32:55.682
- Would that be okay?
- The public is quite upset.

32:56.182 --> 32:57.058
It's okay.

33:00.019 --> 33:02.981
Is there something you know?
How are you so confident?

33:03.064 --> 33:06.275
It's not plagiarized.
So don't worry and keep working.

33:31.217 --> 33:33.928
Hey, how is Ung? What did he say?

33:34.012 --> 33:35.555
Can't you see he's kicked me out?

33:36.180 --> 33:37.515
He's upset, isn't he?

33:39.017 --> 33:41.769
He remained tight-lipped,
so I just gave up.

33:41.853 --> 33:44.814
Damn it.
We should counter that allegation.

33:44.897 --> 33:47.316
Let him be.
He doesn't want to be involved.

33:47.400 --> 33:51.988
This is what I think.
He and Nu-a must have known each other.

33:52.071 --> 33:54.574
But it's frustrating
because he won't tell me anything.

33:55.283 --> 33:56.617
Do you know anything?

33:58.870 --> 34:01.372
No. But he does seem familiar.

34:11.299 --> 34:14.218
BEER IS LIFE
DAILYBEER

34:15.553 --> 34:18.139
We don't know anything
since he won't talk.

34:18.222 --> 34:19.098
At times,

34:20.016 --> 34:23.269
I just don't know
what's running through his mind.

34:23.936 --> 34:27.148
His mom and I were very busy
ever since he was little.

34:27.231 --> 34:31.861
He'd play in front of the shop
by himself every day.

34:32.445 --> 34:34.155
Maybe that's why he's like that.

34:35.364 --> 34:37.617
But he was different
when he was with Yeon-su.

34:37.700 --> 34:41.037
He seemed energetic and lively.

34:41.120 --> 34:44.832
When I heard that you were filming
that documentary again,

34:44.916 --> 34:47.835
you have no idea
how happy I was to hear that.

34:47.919 --> 34:52.757
I'd be very grateful
if he could become lively again.

35:05.686 --> 35:06.854
Come in.

35:10.233 --> 35:11.067
Ung.

35:12.193 --> 35:13.778
The Soen meeting is tomorrow.

35:14.821 --> 35:16.906
Should I reschedule it
if you're not up for it?

35:17.615 --> 35:18.658
What do you mean?

35:19.325 --> 35:21.494
What if they bring up
that plagiarism issue?

35:21.577 --> 35:23.121
It's fine. You don't have to do that.

35:24.122 --> 35:25.915
Did anyone call us about that?

35:25.998 --> 35:26.999
You mean, Soen?

35:27.667 --> 35:30.628
Well, just anyone.

35:30.711 --> 35:31.587
No.

35:33.339 --> 35:35.842
I see. You can go.

35:36.884 --> 35:38.427
Okay, then.

35:39.053 --> 35:42.849
I'm going to sleep at home today.
I hope you get some sleep tonight.

35:43.432 --> 35:44.559
- Bye.
- Bye.

35:57.697 --> 35:58.739
What's going on?

35:59.532 --> 36:01.450
Does she have no interest in me?

36:15.882 --> 36:18.217
RISING STAR KO-O ACCUSED OF PLAGIARISM

36:31.147 --> 36:35.151
NU-A DRAWS USING A DRAWING TABLET
WHILE KO-O DRAWS BY HAND

37:00.801 --> 37:04.096
How could you make me wait
and still call yourself a manager?

37:04.180 --> 37:06.432
I'm really sorry. I'm almost there.

37:06.515 --> 37:10.311
Just head inside, say hello,
and sit down. Okay?

37:10.394 --> 37:11.395
Bye.

37:14.357 --> 37:15.441
Well…

37:15.983 --> 37:17.151
I'm afraid

37:18.152 --> 37:19.737
I'll have to find a new manager.

37:24.450 --> 37:27.078
I knew it. I was right about them.
Myeong-ho.

37:27.662 --> 37:28.621
Yes?

37:28.704 --> 37:31.457
Did you see Mr. Jang a while ago?

37:31.540 --> 37:34.418
He looked for Ms. Kook
as soon as he arrived.

37:34.502 --> 37:35.628
He even brought her coffee.

37:35.711 --> 37:38.506
Yes, I saw him. Now I believe you.

37:38.589 --> 37:39.715
Believe what?

37:40.758 --> 37:43.511
Mr. Jang has a crush on Ms. Kook.

37:43.594 --> 37:45.554
Right. You weren't
at the previous meeting.

37:45.638 --> 37:47.265
It was obvious that day.

37:48.766 --> 37:52.436
He was overly kind to Ms. Kook
despite his nasty temper.

37:52.520 --> 37:54.647
See? I'm telling you.

37:55.231 --> 37:58.567
The meeting is about to begin.
Is everything ready?

37:58.651 --> 37:59.735
I took care of it.

37:59.819 --> 38:01.779
- Goodness.
- Thank you.

38:01.862 --> 38:04.323
Is Go-oh here? I can't wait.

38:04.407 --> 38:05.658
Same here.

38:05.741 --> 38:08.244
- If you're that eager, join the meeting.
- Okay.

38:08.828 --> 38:11.747
- I'll be waiting inside.
- Okay.

38:11.831 --> 38:13.040
- Bye.
- Bye.

38:13.124 --> 38:14.292
My goodness!

38:15.459 --> 38:16.794
Did I spill my coffee?

38:17.503 --> 38:21.090
That could have been catastrophic.
How may I help…

38:22.633 --> 38:26.178
What? No way! You're Choi Ung!

38:44.322 --> 38:46.115
This way, please.

38:46.657 --> 38:47.658
Please.

38:55.041 --> 38:57.126
- We can skip this part.
- Okay.

38:57.209 --> 39:00.004
- We should take it from here.
- Okay.

39:02.298 --> 39:03.424
Excuse me.

39:04.342 --> 39:06.802
Mr. Jang has a crush on Ms. Kook.

39:14.018 --> 39:17.396
Should we begin once your manager arrives?

39:17.480 --> 39:20.399
It's okay. We can start right away.

39:20.483 --> 39:22.360
I think it'd be best if he came.

39:23.110 --> 39:26.530
Then would you mind if I ask you
a few questions before we begin?

39:27.448 --> 39:28.532
Sure.

39:29.575 --> 39:31.744
I'd like to ask about
the ongoing controversy.

39:33.829 --> 39:35.331
Did you plagiarize him?

39:35.414 --> 39:37.666
- Mr. Jang--
- I tend to be straightforward.

39:38.667 --> 39:41.587
I'm sorry if I offended you,
but this is very important to us.

39:49.678 --> 39:51.013
Must I answer that?

39:51.097 --> 39:52.932
That'd be best for our sake.

40:04.485 --> 40:07.154
There's nothing to worry about.
I didn't do such a thing.

40:08.739 --> 40:11.784
From what I know,
plagiarism isn't all black and white.

40:11.867 --> 40:14.662
I heard it's difficult to prove
that you didn't plagiarize anyone.

40:14.745 --> 40:16.330
How will you go about it?

40:16.414 --> 40:18.666
Are you certain
that this won't be an issue?

40:18.749 --> 40:21.043
Sir, I don't think
that's something you should--

40:21.127 --> 40:22.336
It's simple.

40:23.003 --> 40:25.214
There are many reasons
to back my argument,

40:25.297 --> 40:28.134
but they won't find any proof
that I plagiarized anything.

40:28.217 --> 40:29.802
That's why I'm confident.

40:34.557 --> 40:35.850
Thank you for your reply.

40:35.933 --> 40:38.310
I had no choice but to confirm this.

40:38.394 --> 40:40.896
It was obnoxious of me to do so,
but I had to ask.

40:40.980 --> 40:43.816
Since you're certain,
I'll trust you and resume this project.

40:44.525 --> 40:45.651
Sure. It's fine.

40:45.734 --> 40:49.321
By the way, if you're free this Friday,

40:49.864 --> 40:52.199
would you like to attend
Soen's opening party?

40:52.908 --> 40:55.411
I'd also like to make up
for my behavior today.

40:55.494 --> 40:58.873
- I'll have to think about--
- Ms. Kook will be attending as well.

41:01.584 --> 41:02.793
You are, aren't you?

41:04.378 --> 41:06.172
Well…

41:11.177 --> 41:12.636
I'll go.

41:15.764 --> 41:17.099
Thank you for the invitation.

41:19.477 --> 41:21.896
Hello. I'm sorry for being late.

41:21.979 --> 41:23.063
Please sit down.

41:23.147 --> 41:24.148
Okay.

41:25.274 --> 41:28.611
All right, then.
Let's skip the first half.

41:28.694 --> 41:31.030
You better not be late
for another meeting.

41:31.113 --> 41:33.657
I'm truly sorry. Should we get a cab?

41:34.283 --> 41:35.284
Hold on.

41:38.287 --> 41:40.581
Have you ever been to a party before?

41:41.207 --> 41:44.460
A party? What kind? A birthday party?

41:44.543 --> 41:46.879
No. A classy one.

41:46.962 --> 41:48.672
Oh, that kind.

41:49.340 --> 41:50.758
- Have you?
- No.

41:50.841 --> 41:53.385
I only saw them on TV.
I've never been to one. But why?

41:54.720 --> 41:56.805
What am I supposed to wear?

41:58.307 --> 42:00.267
A tuxedo and a bow tie?

42:03.312 --> 42:05.481
Forget it. I shouldn't have asked.

42:05.564 --> 42:06.941
What's this about?

42:07.775 --> 42:10.319
Never mind. Go home first.
I need to stop by somewhere.

42:10.986 --> 42:13.739
Ji-ung, let's end it here.
This is private.

42:13.822 --> 42:17.451
- It's my job to film your private life.
- I'm sure you got enough footage today.

42:17.535 --> 42:21.413
And if you never give me any privacy,
I'm just going to drop out.

42:22.039 --> 42:23.415
I'll let it slide for today.

42:23.499 --> 42:26.335
But that threat
is going to get old very soon.

42:30.130 --> 42:31.090
Where is he going?

42:31.757 --> 42:32.883
It'll look great on you.

42:54.905 --> 42:56.824
KOOK YEON-SU

43:17.928 --> 43:19.221
- This way.
- Okay.

43:20.514 --> 43:21.724
This way.

43:31.525 --> 43:32.860
You're here.

43:34.987 --> 43:38.198
I never thought I'd visit
a place like this in my lifetime.

43:39.116 --> 43:42.411
I'm obviously underdressed, aren't I?

43:43.245 --> 43:45.205
Don't worry. I'm here.

43:46.040 --> 43:49.001
I never expected you
to want to shop with me.

43:49.084 --> 43:50.419
You're always unpredictable.

43:50.502 --> 43:52.546
I'm sorry. You must have been flustered.

43:53.213 --> 43:55.382
I was only flustered
that I couldn't say no

43:55.466 --> 43:56.842
since I had some free time.

43:56.925 --> 43:58.260
That's a relief.

43:58.344 --> 44:00.512
Anyway, thank you for your help.

44:00.596 --> 44:03.599
I promise to repay you for your kindness.

44:03.682 --> 44:06.602
Honestly, I've never bought a suit,

44:06.685 --> 44:08.187
so I didn't know what to buy.

44:08.729 --> 44:10.648
And you were the only one
I could think of.

44:10.731 --> 44:13.233
Hey. I like what you just said.

44:15.903 --> 44:18.822
I hope it'll stay that way.

44:19.448 --> 44:20.324
Okay.

44:20.908 --> 44:23.535
All right, then. Shall we have some fun?

44:42.638 --> 44:43.472
NJ.

45:01.949 --> 45:04.159
It's quite comfortable. How are these?

45:04.243 --> 45:05.494
What about these?

45:24.930 --> 45:26.014
I like it.

45:30.686 --> 45:33.313
NJ, you left your shopping bags.

45:33.897 --> 45:36.525
It's okay.
They'll send them over to my place later.

45:36.608 --> 45:39.445
Gosh, we live in two different worlds.

45:40.487 --> 45:43.198
We shopped for four hours today.

45:43.282 --> 45:44.450
Wasn't that quick?

45:44.533 --> 45:47.870
- And I only shopped for 30 minutes.
- Aren't you famished?

45:47.953 --> 45:50.664
Let me treat you to a meal as a thank-you.

45:50.747 --> 45:52.749
There's something I'm craving.

46:00.007 --> 46:04.595
You know, I may not be
as wealthy as you are.

46:04.678 --> 46:07.556
But I make more than enough.
You could have had something nicer.

46:08.807 --> 46:11.101
Shopping and tteokbokki go hand in hand.

46:11.185 --> 46:14.980
I used to starve myself or have tteokbokki
and fish cakes after shopping

46:15.063 --> 46:17.441
because I felt guilty
for spending too much money.

46:17.524 --> 46:18.484
A guilty pleasure.

46:18.567 --> 46:22.404
I see. I'm actually surprised.

46:22.488 --> 46:24.740
I may seem like I was born to be a star,

46:24.823 --> 46:27.159
but I was just anyone else
when I was young.

46:35.584 --> 46:36.793
Why did you want to shop?

46:36.877 --> 46:38.629
Are you going on TV?

46:39.213 --> 46:41.632
Are you taking your revenge
on that Nu-a guy?

46:41.715 --> 46:42.633
Did you watch that?

46:43.425 --> 46:46.762
Of course. It was all over the news.
I always read the news.

46:49.264 --> 46:50.516
That's not why.

46:51.308 --> 46:52.935
I'm attending a party.

46:53.018 --> 46:54.770
A party?

46:55.854 --> 47:00.317
Then wear the first shirt with no tie.
Match that with the second pair of shoes.

47:00.400 --> 47:02.986
Gosh, you really are a professional.

47:04.988 --> 47:06.740
It's the price of fame.

47:08.075 --> 47:09.117
What?

47:09.618 --> 47:12.079
Fame always comes with a price.

47:12.663 --> 47:14.373
It's because you're now famous

47:14.456 --> 47:16.959
that people are spreading
ridiculous rumors about you.

47:21.296 --> 47:22.130
Thank you.

47:23.924 --> 47:26.677
That means you believe
that I didn't plagiarize him.

47:26.760 --> 47:29.930
Of course. I have a keen eye for art.

47:35.352 --> 47:36.395
Thank you.

47:36.478 --> 47:38.981
- Can we have two soju glasses?
- Okay.

47:39.064 --> 47:40.232
Are we drinking?

47:40.315 --> 47:43.402
Topping off this evening
with some soju would've been perfect.

47:43.986 --> 47:45.487
But I have a photo shoot tomorrow.

47:45.571 --> 47:48.865
I'd crave it too much
if you drank some by yourself,

47:48.949 --> 47:50.993
so let's just pretend this water is soju.

48:03.130 --> 48:07.092
I know you didn't plagiarize anything,
so don't worry about it.

48:17.185 --> 48:20.731
Don't take to heart what Mr. Jang…

48:33.076 --> 48:35.912
I BELIEVE YOU

48:51.887 --> 48:54.806
Baekgu headed straight for the course.

48:54.890 --> 48:56.808
However… Wait a minute.

48:56.892 --> 48:58.727
- Did you see my car keys?
- Just what is going on?

48:59.311 --> 49:00.437
What did you say?

49:01.355 --> 49:02.981
My car keys.

49:03.065 --> 49:05.651
Your car keys?
Why would you suddenly look for them?

49:05.734 --> 49:08.153
You put them away somewhere
since you never drive.

49:13.283 --> 49:15.535
- Did you really not see them?
- Who are you?

49:15.619 --> 49:17.371
I know I look awkward, so shut up.

49:17.454 --> 49:18.830
Are you going on a blind date?

49:18.914 --> 49:20.582
God, just shut up.

49:21.166 --> 49:23.585
That hurt my pride,
but my heart fluttered a bit too.

49:23.669 --> 49:24.836
Hey, come back here.

49:24.920 --> 49:26.380
Just shut up.

49:26.463 --> 49:27.964
Where are you going?

49:28.048 --> 49:29.925
Why aren't you taking me with you?

49:55.617 --> 49:58.578
- Hello.
- It's been a while.

49:58.662 --> 49:59.871
Of course.

50:01.581 --> 50:03.291
Really? You should watch it.

50:14.553 --> 50:15.554
Damn it.

50:15.637 --> 50:18.014
Maybe I shouldn't have come here.
It's so awkward.

50:22.894 --> 50:23.979
I'm sorry.

50:40.370 --> 50:41.663
Where are you going?

50:43.665 --> 50:45.459
You can't just leave after you invited me.

50:45.542 --> 50:48.253
Well, I was just…

50:48.336 --> 50:49.296
Ms. Kook.

50:50.881 --> 50:52.299
- You're here.
- Hello.

50:52.382 --> 50:54.176
You're here too.

50:54.259 --> 50:55.802
Thank you for coming.

50:55.886 --> 50:57.012
I had to keep my word.

50:57.095 --> 50:59.055
Please enjoy the party.

50:59.139 --> 51:01.141
- I'd like to introduce you to someone.
- Okay.

51:01.224 --> 51:02.058
This way.

51:06.897 --> 51:08.398
They're from France.

51:20.285 --> 51:23.371
I have no idea why I came here.

51:25.415 --> 51:26.416
Hey.

51:27.000 --> 51:29.211
You've gone too far
by coming all the way here.

51:29.294 --> 51:32.214
You said you wanted to show everyone
how much you've changed.

51:32.297 --> 51:33.965
Isn't today perfect for that?

51:34.049 --> 51:35.717
Well, not bad, right?

51:35.801 --> 51:36.927
Whatever.

51:38.220 --> 51:40.222
- Let's film Yeon-su now.
- Okay.

51:40.305 --> 51:42.432
Hey, don't bother.

51:42.516 --> 51:45.435
She's surrounded by people
and pretending to be busy.

51:46.520 --> 51:47.395
Bye.

51:57.697 --> 51:58.532
Hey.

51:59.199 --> 52:00.742
Long time no see, Ung.

52:01.576 --> 52:03.662
You really came. How long has it been?

52:06.248 --> 52:09.876
Hey. Where are you going?
I'm talking to you.

52:11.086 --> 52:13.672
I'm not interested.
Why would I ever want to talk to you?

52:15.006 --> 52:17.050
What's going on? Why are you so touchy?

52:17.133 --> 52:19.970
I'm just not interested.
Can you step aside?

52:20.053 --> 52:22.514
Are you still angry at me?

52:23.223 --> 52:24.432
I'm not sure.

52:25.058 --> 52:27.310
I used to pity you a little.

52:27.394 --> 52:28.687
But now I'm indifferent.

52:33.608 --> 52:37.070
Why haven't you countered the allegation?
Am I not worth your time?

52:38.238 --> 52:39.364
You're smart.

52:39.865 --> 52:42.409
Then you must know
that you're wasting my time right now.

52:45.996 --> 52:47.873
Well, I look forward to working with you.

52:50.250 --> 52:51.167
What was that?

52:52.878 --> 52:53.962
What do you mean?

52:54.713 --> 52:57.048
Haven't you heard?
Wait, I can't believe this.

52:58.216 --> 53:00.260
Did you think you were doing it alone?

53:02.095 --> 53:03.013
What?

53:05.473 --> 53:07.017
I'm also doing the live show.

53:07.934 --> 53:09.019
I guess they thought

53:10.103 --> 53:11.521
you weren't good enough alone.

53:24.993 --> 53:27.537
What is he saying?

53:27.621 --> 53:30.415
- This is for the best, right?
- Of course, it is.

53:30.498 --> 53:33.627
Two controversial artists
will be competing against each other.

53:33.710 --> 53:36.171
Gosh. This is great publicity.

53:36.254 --> 53:37.547
Do you think so?

53:37.631 --> 53:40.216
Of course. I knew he was competent.

53:40.800 --> 53:42.218
But he really is incredible.

53:42.969 --> 53:45.138
He seized the opportunity
as soon as the word got out.

53:45.221 --> 53:46.765
- Exactly.
- I'm excited.

53:46.848 --> 53:47.724
Me too.

53:49.976 --> 53:50.810
Hey. Over there.

53:51.978 --> 53:53.063
Yeon-su.

53:55.690 --> 53:56.691
Yes?

53:57.901 --> 53:59.152
Were you aware of this too?

54:00.737 --> 54:01.863
Aware of what?

54:03.281 --> 54:04.449
What's going on?

54:05.784 --> 54:09.371
Why is he looking at me like that?

54:09.454 --> 54:10.622
Did you also

54:11.957 --> 54:13.124
know about it?

54:14.918 --> 54:17.253
Sir, what's this about?

54:17.921 --> 54:19.214
Did you know

54:20.465 --> 54:22.884
that Nu-a was also
taking part in this project?

54:24.135 --> 54:25.220
Ms. Kook?

54:28.807 --> 54:30.850
What do you mean?

54:34.688 --> 54:35.855
Sir.

54:36.439 --> 54:38.817
We can talk about that later.

54:40.652 --> 54:41.778
See?

54:42.988 --> 54:44.572
You're always the one…

54:46.616 --> 54:47.826
who ruins me.

55:15.311 --> 55:18.440
I was just being my usual self that day.

55:18.523 --> 55:20.734
It was unlike her to do that.

55:20.817 --> 55:22.819
He was the one who--

55:22.902 --> 55:24.571
She was setting the mood.

55:24.654 --> 55:25.488
EPILOGUE

55:25.572 --> 55:27.032
On that day, she…

55:27.115 --> 55:28.324
Hey.

55:29.701 --> 55:32.162
What are you going to say
during our final interview?

55:32.662 --> 55:33.788
What?

55:34.330 --> 55:36.958
In the previous interview,

55:37.042 --> 55:39.669
you said you were
wasting your time because of me.

55:40.336 --> 55:42.922
You heard that?
You shouldn't have eavesdropped.

55:46.509 --> 55:47.927
How about now?

55:48.845 --> 55:51.097
Do you still think
you're wasting your time?

55:52.348 --> 55:55.143
He looked serious which was unlike him.

55:55.226 --> 55:57.562
Tell me. How do you feel now?

55:58.188 --> 55:59.981
He also asked a strange question.

56:03.234 --> 56:04.110
Well…

56:05.195 --> 56:09.324
I guess I don't
completely feel that way anymore.

56:12.243 --> 56:14.329
Since today is our final shooting,

56:15.121 --> 56:16.664
I'll tell them it was all right.

56:19.709 --> 56:22.337
She even smiled at me.

56:25.006 --> 56:26.841
What about you? How was it?

56:30.386 --> 56:33.014
Tell me. What are you going to say?

56:33.681 --> 56:37.227
"She's annoying,
bothersome, and irritating."

56:37.310 --> 56:38.978
"I wish she never came to school."

56:39.062 --> 56:40.396
"I'd hit her if I could--"

56:40.480 --> 56:43.274
That's enough. I get it, so stop.

56:44.776 --> 56:45.944
Why did I even ask?

56:46.027 --> 56:49.531
- And…
- I get that you don't like me.

56:49.614 --> 56:52.700
That's not true.

56:54.452 --> 56:58.081
That's why I blurted out
something so ridiculous.

56:59.290 --> 57:00.834
I don't dislike you.

57:08.675 --> 57:11.845
Thank you for not disliking me.

57:16.432 --> 57:18.434
He kept staring at me.

57:19.018 --> 57:20.228
It was so strange.

57:25.316 --> 57:26.401
What about you?

57:37.579 --> 57:38.496
Hey.

57:39.080 --> 57:40.582
Your face is red.

57:43.001 --> 57:44.836
You're running a fever.

57:44.919 --> 57:46.212
I see.

57:46.296 --> 57:48.423
What do you mean? Are you okay?

57:48.506 --> 57:49.883
You're burning up.

57:50.925 --> 57:52.886
No, I'm fine.

57:52.969 --> 57:54.679
Don't be ridiculous.

57:54.762 --> 57:56.222
Here.

57:56.306 --> 57:57.932
I'm fine. Take it.

57:58.016 --> 58:01.311
I don't want you blaming me. Take it.
So much for trying to look cool.

58:01.394 --> 58:03.605
I really am fine. Put it back on.

58:03.688 --> 58:06.983
You were only in the rain for a second.
How are you so weak?

58:07.066 --> 58:09.527
Didn't I tell you
that taking care of your health

58:09.611 --> 58:12.864
- was also an important virtue?
- There you go again.

58:12.947 --> 58:14.824
Are you seriously nagging me right now?

58:14.908 --> 58:16.784
Be quiet and put this back on.

58:17.911 --> 58:20.538
Come on. I take back
what I said about not disliking you.

58:27.086 --> 58:30.632
The person who made things weird

58:30.715 --> 58:32.383
was Ung.

58:32.467 --> 58:33.593
Does that mean

58:34.177 --> 58:36.012
you hate me?

58:38.097 --> 58:40.642
Or was it because of the weather?

58:41.226 --> 58:42.101
No.

58:42.977 --> 58:45.730
Or was it because of my fever?

58:46.314 --> 58:47.273
Then?

58:47.357 --> 58:50.818
Or was I running a fever as well?

58:50.902 --> 58:52.320
I'm certain

58:52.403 --> 58:55.657
that it was because of
the unpredictable weather.

58:56.574 --> 58:57.825
This isn't good.

59:04.749 --> 59:06.501
I think I like you.

59:32.652 --> 59:36.072
Were you friends with Ms. Kook too?

59:36.155 --> 59:38.032
I'm not sure.

59:38.116 --> 59:41.578
I think I've always been just an observer.

59:44.414 --> 59:51.421
THE BOY, OR THE GIRL, WE LIKED THEN

01:00:13.067 --> 01:00:14.611
This is how Ung always was.

01:00:14.694 --> 01:00:18.448
His whole world would shatter
whenever Yeon-su appeared.

01:00:18.531 --> 01:00:19.824
How is it that hard
for you to say you're sorry?

01:00:19.907 --> 01:00:21.909
I'm the one who gives in
in the end anyway.

01:00:23.411 --> 01:00:25.663
I'll do it. I'll work with Nu-a.

01:00:26.956 --> 01:00:29.334
Something more artistic…

01:00:29.417 --> 01:00:31.502
- Did it just throw up?
- Do you want to die?

01:00:32.086 --> 01:00:33.630
I'm sorry.

01:00:33.713 --> 01:00:35.423
Let's not let our emotions get in the way.

01:00:37.050 --> 01:00:40.553
Subtitle translation by: Soo-ji Kim
